ent-ActionYautjaToggleClaws = Extend Claws
    .desc = Extend or retract the wrist blades built into your bracer.

ent-ActionYautjaToggleShield = Extend Shield
    .desc = Extend or retract the wrist shield built into your bracer.

ent-ActionYautjaToggleCloak = Cloak
    .desc = Toggles full cloaking. Stays invisible while moving or being hit. Requires a Yautja cloak in the backpack slot.

ent-ActionYautjaSelfDestruct = Self Destruct
    .desc = Initiates the bracer self-destruct protocol. Detonates with macro-bomb force after the countdown.

ent-ActionYautjaObservationProjection = Psionic Projection
    .desc = Leave your body as an incorporeal observer. Use the return action to return to your body.

ent-ActionYautjaObservationReturn = Return to Body
    .desc = Return from the observation projection to your body.

yautja-bracer-claws-extend = Extend claws
